The [[Customer Card]] is an item available in the shop for all characters, at rare rarity. Its only effect is that when the shop is refreshed (including on entering the shop after a fight), the rarity of 1 item will be increased and there is a 10% chance of trade. The text of the item doesn't make this abundantly clear, but when an item has its rarity increased, it seems to only increase by one level.

The [[Customer Card]] is quite useful, especially in the early-game, where if the player is lucky, they can get certain powerful, high rarity items, much earlier than is normally possible. Two [[Customer Card]]s can craft into a [[Platinum Customer Card]], which helps for finding [[Treasure]], gives a higher trade chance, and even mildly effects the combat itself.

